  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set your air fryer to 200°C.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• In a large bowl combine cauliflower with a drizzle of olive oil and chermoula spice blend.\n• Toss to coat.\n• Place cauliflower into the air fryer basket and cook for 6-8 minutes. Allow to cool slightly.\n• TIP: No air fryer? Prep cauliflower as above and add to a microwave-safe plate with a splash of water.\n• Cover with damp paper towel. Microwave on high for 3 minutes. Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Drain excess water from cauliflower. Add cauliflower to pan and cook, until softened and browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-e8255200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice onion (see ingredients).\n• Roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine half the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil, stirring to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-e0d77510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the remaining garlic and lentils and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-8f0e4920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with lentils, add the water and stock concentrate and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-000a8a30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-ec4d8740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide lentil-couscous between bowls.\n• Top with salad and roast cauliflower.\n• Drizzle over garlic yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle over roasted almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977df6326cd47f1a599ec/step-ee169950.jpg"
    }
  ]
